      "description": "Repository health reports for THIS repository: the one `health-report/v1` document `bun run cat-harness-tools/test/health/run.ts --instance <this instance>` writes. Each repository carries its own report. The graph typology is cat-harness's; its `health` entry says what separates a health report (about the repository) from a `qa` verdict (about an artefact). It sits at the root, not under `test/`, because `test/` is declared as code and a declared directory may not nest inside another; at the root a state graph's path equals its id, as `beans/` does.",
